  "description": "<h1 data-blockid=\"replaceWithId\" data-depth=\"0\" id=\"replaceWithId\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">About Us</h1>\r\n<p data-blockid=\"replaceWithId\" data-depth=\"0\">At Oh Undies, we design Affirmation-Infused Underwear that&rsquo;s all about celebrating you! Our diverse collection has been specifically designed to not only be comfortable and stylish but also to encourage positivity and self-love among women, tweens, and teens.</p>\r\n<p data-blockid=\"replaceWithId\" data-depth=\"0\">Founded on the belief that every individual deserves to feel good about themselves, our product range is unique, fun and empowering. Each piece of our underwear carries an affirmation, a positive vibe, a whisper of self-love that you carry with you throughout your day. Our hope is that as you put on our Affirmation-Infused Underwear each morning, you'll be reminded of your worth, your strength, and your ability to conquer whatever lies ahead.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\"><strong>Payment Terms</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Payment made once per calendar month. We pay on the 1st day of the following month for all sales the previous month.</span></p>",
